  ProjectName: Machine Display
  ClientName: Siroco
  Tags: 2
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead developer.
  - category: 1
    info: 'Siroco designs innovative engineering solutions and produces high-precision
      mechanical parts and tools in small series.

      

'
  - category: 2
    info: 'A VR showroom that presents the client''s machines in high detail, along
      with the technical information for each one. It started on HTC Vive with the
      SteamVR plugin and later moved to the Oculus SDK.

      

'
  - category: 3
    info: 'The machine models were very detailed, and showing them while holding
      a stable VR frame rate was hard.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: '- Changed the presentation to show one machine at a time, which kept rendering
      cost under control.

      - Wrote a custom dissolve shader to transition
      between machines, which turned the constraint into a polished part of the experience.'
